    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000rgkr](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000rgkr) Magnitude 6.0 earthquake at 59.326 depth occurred on Oct 11 2025 11km E of Cagwait. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 8.92 longitude 126.3963. It impacted 147451 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
